[2] https://ci.debian.net/packages/r/r-bioc-ensembldb/testing/amd64/
[3] https://qa.debian.org/excuses.php?package=r-bioc-genomicfeatures
[4] https://wiki.debian.org/ContinuousIntegration/TriagingTips
[5] #debci on oftc or debian-ci at lists.debian.org
